usage: verify_repeated_workflow.py [-h] [--reference REFERENCE]
                                   [--wait-for-lock WAIT_FOR_LOCK]
                                   report

Verify repeated edit measurements; output only counts and hashes, including
for private cases.

positional arguments:
  report

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --reference REFERENCE
  --wait-for-lock WAIT_FOR_LOCK
                        wait up to this many seconds for other task work to
                        finish
